#. metadata.json->name
msgid "ShutdownMenu-change"
msgstr "關機選單（修改版）"

#. metadata.json->description
msgid "Offers a shutdown menu with scroll workspace switching, middle-click actions, custom menu items, grid layout, and scene presets — unlocking more ways to play."
msgstr "提供關機選單，支援滾輪切換工作區、中鍵快捷操作、自訂選單項目、網格佈局和情境預設，解鎖更多玩法。"

